---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import LightManagerTabs from '../../components/LightManagerTabs.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<DocLayout title="UI List Component">
  <h1>Light Manager — UI List Component</h1>
  <LightManagerTabs activeTab="light-manager/ui-list" />
  <p class="mb-6">
    The <strong>UI List</strong> is the visual representation of the scene's lighting hierarchy inside Scene Light Manager. It provides a dense, information-rich view of every light and emitter object in your scene.
  </p>

  <!-- Main UI List Image -->
  <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl mb-8 group hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/5 mb-3 flex justify-center">
      <img 
        src={`${base}panel_images/ui_list.png`} 
        alt="UI List Component" 
        class="h-auto max-h-[350px] object-contain transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.01] zoomable-img cursor-zoom-in"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <span class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px] block font-mono text-center">Main UI List interface layout</span>
  </div>

  <h2>1. The Main UI List Structure</h2>
  <p class="mb-6">
    The central list displays your scene structure, divided into three main types of rows: **World Rows**, **Collection Header Rows**, and **Light Object Rows**.
  </p>

  <!-- A. World Row -->
  <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      <Icon name="WORLD" /> A. World Row
    </h3>
    <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light">
      Appears at the very top of the list (can be hidden in options) and represents the active environment shading:
    </p>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs">
      <!-- Card: World Label -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 font-mono text-white text-xs">
            <Icon name="WORLD" />
            <span>World Label</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Displays the active world background shader block currently driving the environment ambient color.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Mute World -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 font-mono text-white text-xs">
            <Icon name="HIDE_OFF" />
            <span>Mute World</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Toggles the world background shader on/off. When muted, it isolates scene lights against pure black. <em>Lights up red when muted.</em>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Isolate World -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2 font-mono text-white text-xs">
            <Icon name="STICKY_UVS_LOC" />
            <span>Isolate World</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Isolates the world lighting contribution, temporarily disabling all other scene lights to inspect environment-only conditions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- B. Collection Header Rows -->
  <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      <Icon name="COLLECTION_NEW" /> B. Collection Header Rows
    </h3>
    <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light">
      Represent rig folders or scene collections, featuring collapse triggers and bulk override locks:
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs">
      <!-- Card: Navigation & Collapsing -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="OUTLINER" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Navigation & Control</strong>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="RIGHTARROW" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Collapse / Expand:</strong> Toggles children visibility in the list hierarchy.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="CON_TRACKTO" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Select Target:</strong> Selects the rig's tracking target empty object.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="EMPTY_AXIS" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Select Controller:</strong> Selects the rig's main transform controller empty.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Overrides -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="LOCKED" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Inherited Overrides</strong>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="LOCKED" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /><Icon name="LIGHT_GROUP" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Light Group Lock:</strong> Parent-level Light Group override.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="LOCKED" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /><Icon name="LIGHT_LINKING" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Light Linking Lock:</strong> Parent-level Light Linking override.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="LOCKED" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /><Icon name="SHADOW_LINKING" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Shadow Linking Lock:</strong> Parent-level Shadow Linking override.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="icon_exposure_override" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Exposure Override:</strong> Active parent-level Exposure override.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Indicators -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="STICKY_UVS_LOC" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Status Indicators</strong>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="STICKY_UVS_LOC" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Isolate:</strong> Lights up if this collection is currently soloed.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="PINNED" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Pin:</strong> Lights up if the collection visibility is pinned.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-800 text-[10px] text-zinc-400 font-mono">Count</span>
            <strong>Children Count:</strong> Shows the number of lights inside, e.g. <code>(3)</code>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Visibility Toggles -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="HIDE_OFF" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Visibility Toggles</strong>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="RESTRICT_SELECT_OFF" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Selectability:</strong> Toggle viewport selectability.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="HIDE_OFF" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Viewport:</strong> Toggle standard viewport visibility.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="RESTRICT_RENDER_OFF" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Render:</strong> Toggle final render visibility (F12).
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="LOCKED" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Driver Lock:</strong> Active if properties are driven by animations.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- C. Light Object Rows -->
  <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl mb-8">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
      <Icon name="LIGHT" /> C. Light Object Rows
    </h3>
    <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light">
      Represent individual light sources, meshes, or helpers:
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs">
      <!-- Card: Light Type Icons -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="LIGHT" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Emitter Type Icons</strong>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 text-[10px] text-zinc-400">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="LIGHT_POINT" class="w-3 h-3" /> Point Light</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="LIGHT_SUN" class="w-3 h-3" /> Sun Light</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="LIGHT_SPOT" class="w-3 h-3" /> Spot Light</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="LIGHT_AREA" class="w-3 h-3" /> Area Light</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="icon_bouncer" class="w-3 h-3" /> Bouncer</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="icon_blocker" class="w-3 h-3" /> Blocker</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="icon_meshlight" class="w-3 h-3" /> Mesh Light</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="OUTLINER_OB_MESH" class="w-3 h-3" /> Mesh Emitter</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="OUTLINER_OB_EMPTY" class="w-3 h-3" /> Empty</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><Icon name="WORLD" class="w-3 h-3" /> HDRI Sphere</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Assignment Buttons -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="LINK_BLEND" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Relationship Assignment</strong>
        <p class="text-[10px] text-zinc-500 mb-2 font-light">Clicking opens a quick popup menu to assign the light to a group/linking:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icon name="LIGHT_GROUP" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Light Group (LG):</strong> Cycles compositor routing.</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icon name="LIGHT_LINKING" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Light Linking (LL):</strong> Receive objects.</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icon name="SHADOW_LINKING" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Shadow Linking (SL):</strong> Cast shadows overrides.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Status & Isolation -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="STICKY_UVS_LOC" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Status & Isolation</strong>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="STICKY_UVS_LOC" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Isolate:</strong> Indicates if this specific light is currently soloed in the viewport.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card: Visibility Controls -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-950/40 border border-white/5 p-4 rounded-xl hover:border-amber-500/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="HIDE_OFF" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> Visibility Controls</strong>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="RESTRICT_SELECT_OFF" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Selectability:</strong> Toggle viewport selectability.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="HIDE_OFF" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Viewport Eye:</strong> Toggle viewport visibility.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Icon name="RESTRICT_RENDER_OFF" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> <strong>Render Camera:</strong> Toggle render visibility.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="my-8 border-white/5" />

  <h2>2. Inline Expanded Details Sub-Row</h2>
  <blockquote class="mb-6">
    <p>
      <strong>[NOTE] Expanded Sub-Row Interface:</strong>
      If a light is selected (and "Auto Expand" is enabled) or if "Expand All Details" is enabled, an indented sub-row <code>└─</code> opens displaying properties directly within the list:
    </p>
  </blockquote>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-xs mb-6">
    <!-- Card: Lights Details -->
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl hover:border-amber-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300">
      <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="LIGHT" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> For Lights</strong>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light mb-2">Provides inline adjustment parameters:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-1 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light list-disc pl-4">
        <li><strong>Target Pointer:</strong> Direct target assignment.</li>
        <li><strong>Power Slider:</strong> Edits <code>energy</code> value in Watts.</li>
        <li><strong>Color Picker:</strong> Edits <code>color</code> value.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Card: Controller Details -->
    <div class="bg-white/[0.01] border border-white/5 p-5 rounded-2xl hover:border-amber-500/20 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-all duration-300">
      <strong class="text-white text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 font-mono"><Icon name="EMPTY_AXIS" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" /> For Controllers/Empties</strong>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light mb-2">Provides empty viewport display properties:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-1 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-light list-disc pl-4">
        <li><strong>Display Type:</strong> Plain Axes, Arrows, Sphere, Cube, etc.</li>
        <li><strong>Display Size:</strong> Viewport size scale.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocLayout>

